<title>FINLAND: HARTWALL HAS NO TIMETABLE FOR COKE TALKS.</title>
<headline>HARTWALL HAS NO TIMETABLE FOR COKE TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>There is no timetable for talks between Hartwall and the Coca-Cola Company on production, sales and distribution of Coca-Cola products in Finland, Hartwall CEO Jussi Lansio said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;I really cannot say anything about the timetable ... but cooperation will continue as long as negotiations are held,&quot; Lansio told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>The two companies' cooperation agreement expires on March 15, and Hartwall said in a statement earlier that talks had been extended beyond that deadline.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
</text>
